  "id": "section-280",
  "title": "谈爬山",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-129.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>128）</b>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　爬山是抗大课程表外的必修科目，在锻炼抗日的干部上，有着很大的意义。锻炼了每个青年的体力，锻炼出民族战士的艰苦奋斗的作风，而且是直接连系到战场的实践教育。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-128.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-130.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
